                                        <span class="info-tip">?<span class="info-tip-text">Shown on agreements and the staff list. "Sub Editor" / "Bureau" enable the Official Staff Record PDF. "State In-Charge" is used for the reporter → In-Charge mapping.</span></span>
                                    </label><select id="addDisplayRole">
